msgid ""
"<h3>Welcome to KDevelop!</h3>"
"\n"
"<p>You can start working on a project by opening an existing or creating a new one via the above buttons.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>If you need help, please check out the <a href=\"https://userbase.kde.org/KDevelop\">User Manual.</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Benvido a KDevelop!</h3>"
"\n"
"<p>Pode comezar a traballar nun proxecto abrindo un existente ou creando un novo cos botóns de enriba.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>Se necesita axuda, consulte o <a href=\"https://userbase.kde.org/KDevelop\">manual de usuario</a>.</p>"

